      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::003::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Diffusion-mediated processes become important in the stated high-temperature regime.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7512559::web::019::4_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grain refinement enhances oxide nucleation by increasing the density of grain-boundary oxidation sites.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The refined grain structure produces a more continuous and stable protective oxide layer than the coarse-grained structure.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9960858::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A continuous surface oxide layer impedes dislocation-mediated deformation.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9969177::web::012::results_and_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A continuous surface oxide layer impedes grain-boundary sliding.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A mechanically robust oxide scale mitigates localized plastic deformation during sliding.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::003::introduction",
        "PMC9960858::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC9969177::web::012::results_and_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The refined coating will have a lower specific wear rate than the coarse-grained baseline at 500–700°C.",
